 "description": "PENDING (not loaded by default; ontology.schema load_schema(include_pending=True)). Person (app_user) and Lot (app_inventory_lot) bindings, declared ahead of the upstream ask Q3 so they are reviewed and tested; when the reporting API serves a relation, move its type into domains/ (replacing the not_served placeholder in people.json or items.json) and its links next to it. Links from served relations to Person or Lot are not declared here: ontology/schema.py pending_links derives them from the generator's foreign keys to an unserved relation (generated/meta/coverage.json prisma_relations_not_bound); they apply to pending files only, so moving a type to domains/ declares them by hand.",
 "upstream_pins": {
  "plx-customer-portal": "790256ca43"
 },
